{"t":"Wheat","s":"wheat-966d9","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Wheat_e84ea4.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Wheat</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Wheat\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wheat_e84ea4.gif\" width=\"50\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flooring<br/>Grass</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkingspeed\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tile Friction</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091221004500&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wheat_e84ea4.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  wheat.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat%20Field\">Wheat Fields</a> around tibia, specifically around <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula\">Fibula</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Greenshore\">Greenshore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a> and east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> Depot.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can cut it with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">scythe</a>. When wheat is cut it grows back in a two real-time <a href=\"#/wiki/Time\">days</a> (after two server-saves).<br/>\nWhen you cut the wheat and look at the tile below it says, \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see wheat. It has just been cut.</span>\"<br/>\nWhen it starts to regrow green it says, \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see wheat. It's not mature yet.</span>\"<br/>\nWheat is only walkable after it is cut in short yellow and green stages.\n</p>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">bread</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cakes</a>, or cookies</b>\n</p><p>You need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">wheat</a> and grinding it in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a> (for bread) or <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a> (for cake)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a> (only for cookies)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the water into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with water or milk. You will get a Lump of Dough or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a><br/>\n3. For cookies, use the Lump of Cake Dough on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a> to get Baking Tray with cookie dough.\n</p>\n4. Use the lump or tray with an oven. You will get your <i>Bread</i>, <i>Cake</i>, or 12 <i>Cookies</i>.</td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\n<p>Cut 200 of these to obtain the Happy Farmer achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">Bunch of Wheat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Cake (Decorated)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/demons-lullaby\">Demon's Lullaby</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dragon-corpse-quest\">Dragon Corpse Quest</a></li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a></li><li>Grass</li><li>Happy Farmer</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a></li><li>Lump of Dough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nostalgia\">Nostalgia</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a></li><li>Party Cake</li><li>Poof Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a></li><li>Status Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\">Sugar Oat</a></li><li>Trembling Effect</li><li>Trough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water (Liquid)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a Foolish Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat%20Field\">Wheat Field</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["demons-lullaby","dragon-corpse-quest","what-a-foolish-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"demons-lullaby","quest":"Demon's Lullaby","step":"1-1","n":4,"title":"Cumprir o pedido","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"dragon-corpse-quest","quest":"Dragon Corpse Quest","step":"1-0","n":4,"title":"Recuperar vida e cortar o trigo","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"what-a-foolish-quest","quest":"What a Foolish Quest","step":"4-1","n":11,"title":"Arranjar 24 Flour","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}